---

<section id="testimonial-grid" class="section section--muted testimonial-grid">
  <!-- kit: testimonial-grid -->
  <div class="container">
    <header class="section-head section-head--center">
      <span class="eyebrow">Reviews</span>
      <h2>Cooked over, carried in, handed down.</h2>
    </header>

    <div class="tg-masonry">
      <figure class="tg-card">
        <p class="tg-stars" aria-label="Rated 5 out of 5"><span aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</span></p>
        <blockquote>
          <p>I've guided for twelve years and the Cable Fold is the first grill I've never left behind. It folds flat in the morning, sears trout at night and cleans up in the coals.</p>
        </blockquote>
        <figcaption>
          <img src="https://i.pravatar.cc/192?img=47" alt="Maya Reyes" width="96" height="96" loading="lazy" />
          <span><strong>Maya Reyes</strong><span>Backcountry guide, Lander, WY</span></span>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      <figure class="tg-card">
        <p class="tg-stars" aria-label="Rated 5 out of 5"><span aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</span></p>
        <blockquote>
          <p>1,900 miles into the PCT and the Trail Kettle is the only thing in my pack I haven't replaced.</p>
        </blockquote>
        <figcaption>
          <img src="https://i.pravatar.cc/192?img=68" alt="Theo Lindqvist" width="96" height="96" loading="lazy" />
          <span><strong>Theo Lindqvist</strong><span>Thru-hiker, Pacific Crest Trail</span></span>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      <figure class="tg-card">
        <p class="tg-stars" aria-label="Rated 5 out of 5"><span aria-hidden="true">★★★★★</span></p>
        <blockquote>
          <p>I bought the Ember Dutch Oven for one camping trip. Now it never leaves my stove: sourdough on Sunday, short ribs midweek, chilli over coals on Saturday. The lid-skillet alone is worth it.</p>
          <p>Two years in, the seasoning is better than the day it arrived.</p>
        </blockquote>
        <figcaption>
          <img src="https://i.pravatar.cc/192?img=5" alt="Amara Nwosu" width="96" height="96" loading="lazy" />
          <span><strong>Amara Nwosu</strong><span>Home cook, Portland, OR</span></span>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>

    <div class="btn-row tg-cta">
      <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/reviews" title="Reviews">Read all 2,418 reviews <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .tg-masonry {
    columns: 3 280px;
    column-gap: 1.25rem;
  }
  .tg-card {
    break-inside: avoid;
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  }
  .tg-stars { color: var(--brand); letter-spacing: 0.12em; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .tg-card blockquote { margin: 0 0 1.25rem; }
  .tg-card blockquote p { font-size: 1.0625rem; line-height: 1.55; }
  .tg-card blockquote p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .tg-card figcaption {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }
  .tg-card figcaption img {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .tg-card figcaption > span { display: grid; line-height: 1.3; }
  .tg-card figcaption > span span { font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--ink-2); }
  .tg-cta { justify-content: center; margin-top: 1.75rem; }
</style>
